        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-05-04T22:53:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Weeeellllllllllllllll...</p><p>Me on&nbsp; the KS Comments section:</p><p>On a more serious note I have a question regarding the Stretch Goals we may not reach. Since this will be an episodic game from what I've been lead to believe, is there a chance we can get certain goals in future episodes if game sales/post-kickstarter pre-ordering goes especially well? The new update brought to life how much certain levels will improve gameplay, and it would be a shame to lose them...</p><p>Underbite:</p><p>the Kickstarter assures the features will be in the game at launch.(<em>reffering to what goals have been unlocked</em>) Our plan is to continue to expand the game so you will likely see the other features over time after launch.</p><p>Edit: Italicized text added by me to add context</p>",
        "post_number": 121,
        "post_type": 1,
